# free, naming the card Bot1 looked at; Bot1 casts it. Later Bot2 surveils with Consider, and Bot1's log says "Bot2
# surveils 1." (CR 701.25) - the Planetarium is Bot1's, so Bot2's surveil triggers nothing.

